{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>End of the line. All passengers must disembark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Last Train</i>, a short first-person psychological horror game, routine turns into nightmare when you fall asleep on the subway. When you wake up, you\u2019ve reached the end of the line \u2014 an abandoned station shrouded in darkness. But you\u2019re not alone; something is waiting in the shadows, watching you, following your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark hallways and hidden corners of the last station as you try to find a way back to safety. Every sound, every movement, could mean the thing chasing you is closer than you think. You'll need to stay calm, solve puzzles, and find clues that reveal the dark secrets hidden in this forgotten station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape before the entity catches you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person horror with a touch of humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A viral social media character is after you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets that reveal a greater story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense experience in a mysterious station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings to unlock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/55a701e2417d76373022887d9b431d49.poster.avif?t=1755133432\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/55a701e2417d76373022887d9b431d49.webm?t=1755133432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/55a701e2417d76373022887d9b431d49.mp4?t=1755133432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Get ready for a one-way ride into fear. The last stop awaits\u2026 and not everyone makes it back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/77e25b04c669dbd9d2f2d1fc4fccf20b.poster.avif?t=1755133432\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/77e25b04c669dbd9d2f2d1fc4fccf20b.webm?t=1755133432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676960/extras/77e25b04c669dbd9d2f2d1fc4fccf20b.mp4?t=1755133432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exit the Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/9809e2832ec5b102f4dfaf33a215007b173ae80b.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet Deal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/36c42d510d5b38f56877542d859dc3a885c3f6a1.jpg"},{"name":"Free Willy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/dec8860cfb9533ac7add4a3f61e17d2662c05195.jpg"},{"name":"Brainrot Biennale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/2191431cf17df73eb9bc9cc317c56e6f3505ac0d.jpg"},{"name":"Who's on 8?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/49839f23d8120013d9123e5478b232b93c7aeb0d.jpg"},{"name":"Cat-astrophic Cuteness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3676960/8b5e0ca7489a9db793c7dd72826d77faa466c092.jpg"},{"name":"Tung'd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste